  "notes": [
    "Class names ending HOLD are review warnings only, not enforced routing locks.",
    "Power trunk widths must be chosen manually at 1.0 mm or wider where practical. Class .60 mm does not establish current rating.",
    "EPD_RESE has a wide current connection Q301.2 to R301.1 and a separate quiet Kelvin branch to J301.3; do not apply narrow sense geometry to its power-current segment.",
    "Power/switch pad escapes need short legal neckdowns to actual pad dimensions; do not change validated lands.",
    "USB numbers are placeholders, not an impedance result. U105 missing; no final USB routing.",
    "NFC and switching hold nets must not be autorouted. Other nets with unresolved endpoints can be connected among resolved pads only.",
    "GND remains Default for small fanouts; use planes and explicitly wider power return paths.",
    "All current and assembly rules remain provisional.",
    "Preferred Power_Trunk1.0 mm replaces v1Power0.60 mm; Power_Escape andPower_Branch are same-net geometry policies, not simultaneous netclass assignments."
  ],
